{"excerpt_id":"ex_5941285ed842_019","source_id":"src_5941285ed842","source_hash":"08848f0378f52141326eacae87a103d6f7ad9e8485faba3a987892db2dc9eace","text":"Concurrent submissions supported: Depending on your subscription tier, you can submit multiple workflows without waiting for previous jobs to complete. Jobs run in parallel up to your tier’s limit — additional jobs queue automatically. See Parallel Execution for details and concurrency limits.","location_hint":"paragraph 122","char_start":3560,"char_end":3854,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:43:03.749Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5941285ed842_020","source_id":"src_5941285ed842","source_hash":"08848f0378f52141326eacae87a103d6f7ad9e8485faba3a987892db2dc9eace","text":"curl -X POST \" $BASE_URL /api/prompt\" \\\n-H \"X-API-Key: $COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY \" \\\n-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n-d &#x27;{\"prompt\": &#x27;\"$( cat workflow_api.json)\"&#x27;}&#x27;","location_hint":"paragraph 128","char_start":3916,"char_end":4100,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:43:03.749Z"}
