{"excerpt_id":"ex_5941285ed842_022","source_id":"src_5941285ed842","source_hash":"08848f0378f52141326eacae87a103d6f7ad9e8485faba3a987892db2dc9eace","text":"The ComfyUI frontend automatically packages your API key into extra_data when running workflows in the browser. This section is only relevant when calling the API directly.","location_hint":"paragraph 132","char_start":4328,"char_end":4500,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:43:03.749Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5941285ed842_023","source_id":"src_5941285ed842","source_hash":"08848f0378f52141326eacae87a103d6f7ad9e8485faba3a987892db2dc9eace","text":"curl -X POST \" $BASE_URL /api/prompt\" \\\n-H \"X-API-Key: $COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY \" \\\n-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n-d &#x27;{\n\"prompt\": &#x27;\"$( cat workflow_api.json)\"&#x27;,\n\"extra_data\": {\n\"api_key_comfy_org\": \"your-comfy-api-key\"\n}\n}&#x27;","location_hint":"paragraph 136","char_start":4538,"char_end":4785,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:43:03.749Z"}
