{"excerpt_id":"ex_5941285ed842_025","source_id":"src_5941285ed842","source_hash":"08848f0378f52141326eacae87a103d6f7ad9e8485faba3a987892db2dc9eace","text":"function setWorkflowInput (\nworkflow : Record < string , any >,\nnodeId : string ,\ninputName : string ,\nvalue : any\n) : Record < string , any > {\nif ( workflow [ nodeId ]) {\nworkflow [ nodeId ]. inputs [ inputName ] = value ;\n}\nreturn workflow ;\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 142","char_start":4972,"char_end":5218,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:43:03.749Z"}
